{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026x4ldafcGPo1787652501.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>兩電下午公布明年電費調整，消息指都會加價。據了解中電建議加百分之1.8，港燈就上調百分之7.9。</p><p></p><p>電費由基本電費及實報實銷的燃料費組成，去年初兩電的淨電費，按年分別減百分之2.6及2.2，不過本月燃料費已較已較一月分別加約兩成及五成半。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T06:45:15.125473+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T05:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:33.532214+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T06:38:33.532214+00:00","content_hash":"875bfa30948466ef21195fb2acf3f7a78e033c057ed60ef55c41a26c75071c75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}